OL,3,GNEWSA'Smart glasses let other people
OL,4,Asee for me'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who is severely sight-impaired
OL,7,Fsays smart glasses that allow remote
OL,8,Fassistants to see his surroundings have
OL,9,Fhelped him gain confidence and
OL,10,Findependence.
OL,12,FIan Torrie, 52, from Mablethorpe,
OL,13,FLincolnshire, lost most of his sight
OL,14,Fabout six years ago after a stroke. For
OL,15,Fnearly a year, he has been using
OL,16,FAI-powered Meta smart glasses to help
OL,17,Fhim with everyday tasks.
OL,19,FUsing an app, Torrie can call on remote
OL,20,Fvolunteers for assistance with cooking,
OL,21,Ffinding misplaced items and even
OL,22,Fchecking whether his shoes match.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
